  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Frontend**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into the React frontend design. Currently focused on component breakdown. First on the list: the top bar. It\'ll feature the brand title \"Blue Carbon Registry\" alongside the National MRV Sub-badge. I\'m aiming for high-taste, responsive design with AA-contrast for accessibility.\n\n\n**Defining Navigation Zones**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining the navigation zones for the frontend. The structure will use single-line tabs: \"Sites & Live MRV,\" \"Consensus Engine,\" \"Blockchain Ledger,\" and more. The primary action will be \"Verify Ledger Chain,\" featuring a status pill for quick verification.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Ledger**\n\nMy current focus is on the Blockchain Audit Trail and Ledger Explorer. I\'m visualizing the hash-chain linkage with color-coded block types and clickable cards providing detailed cryptographic info, including a JSON payload inspector. I\'m also planning a Live Demo Tamper Simulator to demonstrate the ledger\'s integrity, complete with visual failure points and a restore function.\n\n\n**Implementing Retirement Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the credit retirement feature. It\'ll include a table of serialized credit tokens, filtered and searchable. The core action is \"Retire Credit,\" which triggers a modal form for beneficiary details, retirement reason, and standard. Upon confirmation, the system permanently burns the credit and generates a cryptographic certificate with a QR code and validator signature. I am also working on the Buffer-Reserve and Reversal Risk Safeguard View, which explains the importance of our differentiation.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 716124588
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
