        }
        lines {
          text: "        <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          Blue Carbon Registry: Executive Summary & Judge Pitch"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        </h2>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "        <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          India possesses over 4,992 sq km of mangrove forests capable of sequestering up to 4-10x more carbon per hectare than terrestrial tropical rainforests. However, blue carbon credit markets have suffered from <strong>unverified claims, manual audit delays (6-18 months), and catastrophic reversal risks</strong>. This platform solves all three through <strong>automated tri-source MRV consensus and an on-chain buffer-reserve safeguard</strong>."
