          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              \"Notice the split: <strong>80% is minted as tradeable carbon credits, but 20% is held in a ring-fenced Buffer Reserve</strong>. Now let\'s simulate a Category-4 Super Cyclone hitting Sundarbans in our <strong>Buffer Reserve tab</strong>. The canopy suffers 38% defoliation. The next MRV audit detects a carbon loss of 11,700 tCO\342\202\202e. The platform <strong>instantly executes an automated Reversal Burn on the buffer pool</strong> \342\200\224 commercial credit buyers hold 100% solvent credits, and zero phantom carbon enters the Indian economy.\""
