  planner_response {
    response: "The **Blue Carbon Registry \342\200\224 Blockchain-Audited Blue Carbon MRV & Credit Registry for Indian Mangrove Ecosystems** (SIH-26193) is built and ready.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Highlights & Architecture\n\n1. **Single-Command, Zero-Configuration Full Stack (`npm run dev`)**:\n   - Boots a unified Express backend on port `3000` with the complete MRV consensus engine, SHA-256 cryptographic ledger, and API endpoints, directly serving the React SPA with no manual wiring.\n\n2. **Tri-Source MRV Consensus Engine**:\n   - **Sentinel-2 / SAR Satellite:** NDVI, EVI, C-band SAR backscatter, and canopy area.\n   - **RTK-LiDAR Drone Telemetry:** Canopy height (CHM), crown closure %, and hyperspectral Chl-a.\n   - **In-situ IoT Ground Sensor Mesh:** Deep Soil Organic Carbon (0\342\200\22330cm and 30\342\200\223100cm), salinity (PSU), redox potential (mV), and flux chamber sequestration rates.\n   - Evaluates multi-source variance against a 14% tolerance ceiling before authorizing carbon credit minting.\n\n3. **India-Calibrated IPCC Tier-3 Allometric Math**:\n   - Implements Komiyama allometric models calibrated for Indian coastal mangrove species (*Rhizophora mucronata*, *Avicennia marina*, *Bruguiera gymnorhiza*, *Heritiera fomes*).\n   - Computes Above-Ground Biomass (AGB), Below-Ground Root Biomass (BGB = 0.49 \303\227 AGB), Soil Organic Carbon (SOC) stocks, and net annual $t\\text{CO}_2e$ sequestration with a 5% conservative uncertainty discount.\n\n4. **The 80/20 Buffer Reserve Differentiator (Solves the Toucan Protocol Failure)**:\n   - Mints **80% tradeable active credits** and ring-fences **20% into a permanent, non-tradeable risk reserve**.\n   - **Automated Reversal Trigger:** When an extreme weather disturbance (e.g. Category-4 Super Cyclone in the Sundarbans) defoliates the canopy, the next MRV audit detects the deficit and automatically executes a `BUFFER_REVERSAL_BURN` on the buffer pool. Circulating commercial credits remain 100% solvent.\n\n5. **Cryptographic SHA-256 Hash-Linked Audit Chain**:\n   - Genesis block + SHA-256 block hashing, Merkle roots, and validator signatures.\n   - **Interactive Live Tamper Simulator:** Includes a dev toggle to deliberately mutate any block\'s data payload on demand.\n   - **\"Verify Ledger Integrity\" Action:** Recomputes every block and Merkle root from genesis to tip, detects exact broken blocks in red, and provides a 1-click canonical chain restore.\n\n6. **Credit Lifecycle & Retirement**:\n   - Serialized token tracking (`IN-MNG-SUN-2026-0001` etc.) filterable by status (`TRADEABLE`, `BUFFER_RESERVE`, `RETIRED_OFFSET`, `REVERSAL_BURNED`).\n   - Irreversible retirement flow generating a printable **Official Certificate of Carbon Retirement**.\n\n7. **AI-Powered MRV Summaries & Hackathon Pitch Mode**:\n   - Server-side Gemini integration (`gemini-3.7-flash`) with scientific fallback.\n   - Built-in **SIH Briefing Tab** with the 3-minute judge demo script and the Toucan Protocol case study comparison table."
    thinking: "**Verifying Command Execution**\n\nOkay, I\'ve confirmed that the application fulfills the \'one command\' requirement. Executing `npm run dev` successfully starts the `tsx server.ts` script, initializing the ledger, and serving both the API endpoints and the React app from port 3000. It seems everything is streamlined for a single command execution to launch the entire application.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The **Blue Carbon Registry \342\200\224 Blockchain-Audited Blue Carbon MRV & Credit Registry for Indian Mangrove Ecosystems** (SIH-26193) is built and ready.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Highlights & Architecture\n\n1. **Single-Command, Zero-Configuration Full Stack (`npm run dev`)**:\n   - Boots a unified Express backend on port `3000` with the complete MRV consensus engine, SHA-256 cryptographic ledger, and API endpoints, directly serving the React SPA with no manual wiring.\n\n2. **Tri-Source MRV Consensus Engine**:\n   - **Sentinel-2 / SAR Satellite:** NDVI, EVI, C-band SAR backscatter, and canopy area.\n   - **RTK-LiDAR Drone Telemetry:** Canopy height (CHM), crown closure %, and hyperspectral Chl-a.\n   - **In-situ IoT Ground Sensor Mesh:** Deep Soil Organic Carbon (0\342\200\22330cm and 30\342\200\223100cm), salinity (PSU), redox potential (mV), and flux chamber sequestration rates.\n   - Evaluates multi-source variance against a 14% tolerance ceiling before authorizing carbon credit minting.\n\n3. **India-Calibrated IPCC Tier-3 Allometric Math**:\n   - Implements Komiyama allometric models calibrated for Indian coastal mangrove species (*Rhizophora mucronata*, *Avicennia marina*, *Bruguiera gymnorhiza*, *Heritiera fomes*).\n   - Computes Above-Ground Biomass (AGB), Below-Ground Root Biomass (BGB = 0.49 \303\227 AGB), Soil Organic Carbon (SOC) stocks, and net annual $t\\text{CO}_2e$ sequestration with a 5% conservative uncertainty discount.\n\n4. **The 80/20 Buffer Reserve Differentiator (Solves the Toucan Protocol Failure)**:\n   - Mints **80% tradeable active credits** and ring-fences **20% into a permanent, non-tradeable risk reserve**.\n   - **Automated Reversal Trigger:** When an extreme weather disturbance (e.g. Category-4 Super Cyclone in the Sundarbans) defoliates the canopy, the next MRV audit detects the deficit and automatically executes a `BUFFER_REVERSAL_BURN` on the buffer pool. Circulating commercial credits remain 100% solvent.\n\n5. **Cryptographic SHA-256 Hash-Linked Audit Chain**:\n   - Genesis block + SHA-256 block hashing, Merkle roots, and validator signatures.\n   - **Interactive Live Tamper Simulator:** Includes a dev toggle to deliberately mutate any block\'s data payload on demand.\n   - **\"Verify Ledger Integrity\" Action:** Recomputes every block and Merkle root from genesis to tip, detects exact broken blocks in red, and provides a 1-click canonical chain restore.\n\n6. **Credit Lifecycle & Retirement**:\n   - Serialized token tracking (`IN-MNG-SUN-2026-0001` etc.) filterable by status (`TRADEABLE`, `BUFFER_RESERVE`, `RETIRED_OFFSET`, `REVERSAL_BURNED`).\n   - Irreversible retirement flow generating a printable **Official Certificate of Carbon Retirement**.\n\n7. **AI-Powered MRV Summaries & Hackathon Pitch Mode**:\n   - Server-side Gemini integration (`gemini-3.7-flash`) with scientific fallback.\n   - Built-in **SIH Briefing Tab** with the 3-minute judge demo script and the Toucan Protocol case study comparison table."
