  planner_response {
    response: "The **Immersive UI** design theme has been applied across the entire Blue Carbon Registry application.\n\n### Key Aesthetic & Architecture Upgrades:\n- **Palette & Atmosphere:** Standardized on the dark command-deck palette (`#05080A` canvas, `#080D11` cards, hairline `#1E293B` borders) accented with glowing mint (`#00FF9C`), cyan (`#00D1FF`), amber (`#FF8A00`), and crimson (`#FF4444`).\n- **Telemetry & Map Deck:** Refined the coastal mangrove map and fleet sector cards with radar sweep indicators, monospaced coordinate badges, and real-time cross-sensor gauges.\n- **Consensus & Minting Pipeline:** Upgraded the Tri-Source MRV Consensus modal with animated step progress, 80/20 buffer reserve slider, and cryptographic Merkle verification badges.\n- **Risk Buffer Safeguard:** Formatted the live disturbance simulator with cyclone/surge scenario selectors and real-time on-chain reversal burn execution flows.\n- **Cryptographic Audit Trail:** Styled the SHA-256 block chain with interactive tamper simulation, block hash inspection, and instant ledger integrity checks.\n- **Retirement & Official Certificate:** Styled the permanent burn modal and Government of India offset certificate with formal stamps and verifiable cryptographic transaction IDs."
    modified_response: "The **Immersive UI** design theme has been applied across the entire Blue Carbon Registry application.\n\n### Key Aesthetic & Architecture Upgrades:\n- **Palette & Atmosphere:** Standardized on the dark command-deck palette (`#05080A` canvas, `#080D11` cards, hairline `#1E293B` borders) accented with glowing mint (`#00FF9C`), cyan (`#00D1FF`), amber (`#FF8A00`), and crimson (`#FF4444`).\n- **Telemetry & Map Deck:** Refined the coastal mangrove map and fleet sector cards with radar sweep indicators, monospaced coordinate badges, and real-time cross-sensor gauges.\n- **Consensus & Minting Pipeline:** Upgraded the Tri-Source MRV Consensus modal with animated step progress, 80/20 buffer reserve slider, and cryptographic Merkle verification badges.\n- **Risk Buffer Safeguard:** Formatted the live disturbance simulator with cyclone/surge scenario selectors and real-time on-chain reversal burn execution flows.\n- **Cryptographic Audit Trail:** Styled the SHA-256 block chain with interactive tamper simulation, block hash inspection, and instant ledger integrity checks.\n- **Retirement & Official Certificate:** Styled the permanent burn modal and Government of India offset certificate with formal stamps and verifiable cryptographic transaction IDs."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
